Package: laptop-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gooder24 <162874774+Gooder24@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, util-linux, keyd, systemd-zram-generator
Description: run a laptop as a headless server
 A laptop makes a quiet, frugal server with a battery for a UPS, but out of the
 box it sleeps when its lid closes, keeps its screen lit and holds its battery
 at 100 % for years. With this package the lid does nothing, the machine never
 sleeps, the display goes dark after the start (SUPER+D switches it), charging
 stops at 80 %, swap lives in compressed memory and the boot menu does not
 wait. "laptop-server check" says what works.
